      <h1>Haircare + Trichology Clinic Social Media Management in Pune 2026 &mdash; Complete FAQ</h1>
      <p class="lede">12 answer-first Q&amp;As on social media management (instagram + youtube + facebook) for haircare + trichology + hair loss clinics in Pune, Maharashtra &mdash; costs in INR, compliance (Maharashtra Medical Council + MCI + ASCI medical advertising code), local landmarks (Koregaon Park + Kalyani Nagar + Baner + Aundh + Viman Nagar), booking + patient-acquisition benchmarks, and how ITD GrowthLabs works with clinics that don't have in-house marketing teams.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="itdgl-clinic-intro">
      <p>Social media management for a haircare + trichology clinic in Pune, Maharashtra lives at the intersection of education + trust-building + long-cycle patient nurture. Hair-loss patients research for 4-12 weeks before booking a consultation — social media is the primary evaluation surface. This FAQ answers 12 questions Pune trichology clinics ask about social media management.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-evidence-band">
      <strong>ITD CLINIC MARKETING &mdash; WHAT WE ACTUALLY DO:</strong>
      ITD GrowthLabs runs full-stack digital marketing for haircare + trichology + hair loss clinics across Thane, Mumbai, Navi Mumbai, Dombivli, Kalyan, Nagpur, Nashik, and Pune. Social media management + Reels + viral content, Meta + Google ads, website + online booking + WhatsApp Cloud API integration, Google Business Profile optimisation + local SEO, and patient lead generation. We work with clinics that don't have in-house marketing teams — treating the marketing function as an outsourced growth partner, not a vendor. Every answer below reflects live clinic work.
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-faq-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What does social media management for a haircare + trichology clinic in Pune include?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Monthly: (1) Instagram + Facebook + YouTube content calendar (14-25 posts/month), (2) community management + DM + WhatsApp handoff, (3) Educational carousels on hair loss types + PRP/GFC/mesotherapy science (6-12/month), (4) Reels production (5-10/month, patient education + procedure explainer + before-after growth documentation), (5) Long-form YouTube videos (2-4/month, deeper hair-loss science + patient journey), (6) Stories + polls + Q&amp;A (2-3/day). In Pune with IT + BPO + student + young-professional + auto industry + medical + high-income + culturally-Maharashtrian + educated, content mix skews educational + patient-journey + long-cycle nurture.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is a realistic monthly cost for social media management for a haircare clinic in Pune?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Standalone in Pune: Rs 25,000-55,000/month solo clinic, Rs 55,000-1,10,000/month 2-3 doctor, Rs 1,10,000-2,20,000/month multi-location. Bundled with full marketing retainer (Rs 40,000-3 lakh) more cost-effective. Trichology content velocity slightly lower than dermatology (education-heavy vs procedure-heavy) so cost slightly lower per equivalent scale.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does content calendar planning work for a Pune trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Monthly calendar 2-3 weeks in advance. Content mix: 50-60% educational (hair loss types + PRP/GFC science + male + female pattern loss + genetics + lifestyle), 15-20% patient journey documentation (6-12 month growth timelines with consent + disclaimer), 15-20% procedure explainer + technology + facility content, 5-10% clinic culture + trichologist personality, 5-10% procedure promotions + limited packages. Weekly draft + approval + scheduled publish.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does community management + DM handling work?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Response SLA: within 15 min business hours, within 2 hours off-hours. Trichology inquiries are longer + more research-heavy — first response includes educational content + qualifying questions. Qualified leads to WhatsApp booking flow within 5 min. Trichology-specific: many inquiries need 3-6 touchpoints before booking (long consideration cycle), so nurture-flow discipline critical. Weekly analytics + monthly cohort review.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What ASCI compliance issues arise in trichology social media?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Hair-regrowth claims must be substantiated ('reduces hair fall by X%' requires clinical study), PRP/GFC/mesotherapy positioning must not be miracle-cure, before-after growth needs same lighting + angle + time + consent + disclaimer, no guaranteed outcomes, no comparative claims against products or clinics. In Pune, Maharashtra Medical Council + Maharashtra FDA + PMC (Pune Municipal Corporation) + PCMC enforcement.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What follower growth + engagement benchmarks for a Pune trichology clinic Instagram?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Well-executed: 200-600 new followers/month organic, 4-9% engagement (higher than dermatology because content is more educational + saveable), 30-120 DM inquiries/month at Growth tier, 10-30% DM-to-consultation conversion (higher than dermatology because trichology inquiries are more considered/qualified). Reels reach 3,000-300,000. First 6 months baseline, month 6-12 accelerating.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does WhatsApp + social integration work for a Pune trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Instagram DM → WhatsApp auto-handoff with qualifying summary. WhatsApp flows: welcome + hair-loss assessment questions + trichoscopy consultation booking + confirmation + 24hr/2hr reminder + post-consultation follow-up + treatment plan discussion + long-cycle nurture (weekly during 6-12 month treatment). Marathi + Hindi + English + Gujarati native-speaker templates critical.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What analytics + reporting to expect from social media management for a Pune trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Weekly: follower growth + engagement + reach + Reels + DM volume + WhatsApp inquiries + consultation booking. Monthly + strategy review: full attribution + long-cycle cohort tracking (patients converted 30/60/90/180 days after first DM), competitor benchmarking, next-month calendar. Quarterly business review + 24-month LTV cohort projection.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What are the biggest social media mistakes Pune trichology clinics make?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">(1) Sporadic posting. (2) No Reels. (3) Text-heavy educational without visuals. (4) ASCI-violating hair-regrowth guarantee claims. (5) No before-after growth documentation (compliance-safe). (6) No long-cycle WhatsApp nurture (patients drop off during 6-12 month treatment). (7) Doctor-only voice without patient journey. (8) English-only in Pune. (9) No YouTube long-form (trichology buyer researches extensively). (10) No local-community + hair-loss-awareness content.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does ITD manage social media for Pune trichology clinics differently?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">In-house creative pod dedicated to clinic accounts. Monthly content calendar with ASCI + MCC compliance review, WhatsApp Cloud API long-cycle nurture flows, Marathi + Hindi + English + Gujarati native-speaker copy, long-cycle 24-month cohort attribution reporting, monthly patient-journey mapping, quarterly QBR. Bundled with full marketing retainer (Rs 40,000-3 lakh).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we start social media management with ITD for a Pune trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Free 30-min discovery. We audit current Instagram + YouTube + benchmark against 3-5 competing Pune trichology clinics + share content strategy + tier recommendation + first-30-day plan within 3 working days.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Is standalone social enough or do we need full-service?</h2>
